  "notes": "First flight date is the H3-22 configuration's maiden flight, the family's first. Flight totals are split across H3-22/24/30 configurations in Launch Library, so no aggregate is recorded; the aggregate carried here follows Wikipedia's and JAXA's own sequential family-wide numbering instead. Weekly maintenance 2026-08-13: landed crossfeed candidate 2026-08-11-jaxa-h3-qzs7-michibiki-launch:h3.flights_total (flag_refresh) from JAXA's own first-party press release, which states this launch was \"H3 Launch Vehicle flight No.9\" and confirms QZS-7 separation and orbit injection succeeded; flights_total 8->9, flights_successful 6->7, last_flight_date 2026-06-12->2026-08-11, all re-sourced to the JAXA release. next_flight_date (2026-08-06) was already past due and superseded by this flight; refreshed to 2026-10-31 (MMX, H3-24 configuration) from Launch Library's upcoming-launches endpoint, the nearest dated H3 flight it lists (several others carry only year precision).",
